        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1507_Mephisto_1\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1"
    },
    {
        "id": 34,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mephisto\"]   Aww, still don't feel like coming out?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mephisto",
        "content": "Aww, still don't feel like coming out?"
    },
    {
        "id": 35,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mephisto\"]   Don't think I didn't see your reinforcements coming.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mephisto",
        "content": "Don't think I didn't see your reinforcements coming."
    },
    {
        "id": 36,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mephisto\"]   Well, whatever. I have something to show you. I'm sure you'll like it.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mephisto",
        "content": "Well, whatever. I have something to show you. I'm sure you'll like it."
    },
    {
        "id": 37,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mephisto\"]   Looking back now... We were originally planning to take over Chernobog from the very beginning...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mephisto",
        "content": "Looking back now... We were originally planning to take over Chernobog from the very beginning..."
    },
    {
        "id": 38,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mephisto\"]   We waited for so, so long... and finally our time has come...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mephisto",
        "content": "We waited for so, so long... and finally our time has come..."
    },
    {
        "id": 39,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mephisto\"]   The moment when we take our revenge against Ursus! Against those who persecuted us Infected!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mephisto",
        "content": "The moment when we take our revenge against Ursus! Against those who persecuted us Infected!"
    },
    {
        "id": 40,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mephisto\"]   But, what about the fellows in this sub-city?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mephisto",
        "content": "But, what about the fellows in this sub-city?"
    },
    {
        "id": 41,
        "raw": "[Blocker(a=1, r=0, g=0, b=0, fadetime=0.6, block=true)]",
        "type": "blocker",
        "a": "1,",
        "r": "0,",
        "g": "0,",
        "b": "0,",
        "fadetime": "0.6,",
