        "a": "0,",
        "fadetime": "0.6,",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "id": 45,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mephisto\"]   They ran away.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mephisto",
        "content": "They ran away."
    },
    {
        "id": 46,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mephisto\"]   They had pretty quick reactions. Ran away before we had a chance to take action.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mephisto",
        "content": "They had pretty quick reactions. Ran away before we had a chance to take action."
    },
    {
        "id": 47,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mephisto\"]   Disconnected themselves, and took off as quickly as they could--",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mephisto",
        "content": "Disconnected themselves, and took off as quickly as they could--"
    },
    {
        "id": 48,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mephisto\"]   But where did they hope to escape to?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mephisto",
        "content": "But where did they hope to escape to?"
    },
    {
        "id": 49,
        "raw": "[Blocker(a=1, r=0, g=0, b=0, fadetime=0.6, block=true)]",
        "type": "blocker",
        "a": "1,",
        "r": "0,",
        "g": "0,",
        "b": "0,",
        "fadetime": "0.6,",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "id": 50,
        "raw": "[Image(fadetime=0)]",
        "type": "image",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "id": 51,
        "raw": "[Blocker(a=0, fadetime=0.6, block=true)]",
        "type": "blocker",
        "a": "0,",
        "fadetime": "0.6,",
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "id": 52,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mephisto\"]   Our comrades had long permeated every district, waiting for our opportunity.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mephisto",
        "content": "Our comrades had long permeated every district, waiting for our opportunity."
    },
    {
        "id": 53,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mephisto\"]   In the end, we caught up to them, and gave them the punishment they deserved.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mephisto",
        "content": "In the end, we caught up to them, and gave them the punishment they deserved."
    },
    {
        "id": 54,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mephisto\"]   These cowards, these perpetrators; what were we to do with them?",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mephisto",
        "content": "These cowards, these perpetrators; what were we to do with them?"
    },
    {
        "id": 55,
        "raw": "[Character(name=\"char_1507_Mephisto_1#5\")]",
        "type": "character",
        "name": "char_1507_Mephisto_1#5"
    },
    {
        "id": 56,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mephisto\"]   It's simple - we would make an example of them!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mephisto",
        "content": "It's simple - we would make an example of them!"
    },
    {
        "id": 57,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mephisto\"]   A proclamation that all injustices against the Infected would be purged...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mephisto",
        "content": "A proclamation that all injustices against the Infected would be purged..."
    },
    {
        "id": 58,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mephisto\"]   ...Yes, that is the symbol of the Reunion Movement...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mephisto",
        "content": "...Yes, that is the symbol of the Reunion Movement..."
    },
    {
        "id": 59,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mephisto\"]   Let them all turn into effigies of terror, one by one!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mephisto",
        "content": "Let them all turn into effigies of terror, one by one!"
    },
    {
        "id": 60,
        "raw": "[name=\"Mephisto\"]   You, set that nearby effigy on fire! Let there be light!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Mephisto",
        "content": "You, set that nearby effigy on fire! Let there be light!"
    },
