    },
    {
        "id": 145,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   I am not the same person I was back then..",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "I am not the same person I was back then.."
    },
    {
        "id": 146,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Even though you might not remember...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Even though you might not remember..."
    },
    {
        "id": 147,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   Yes... Back then, I was timid, fragile, and easily scared... I couldn't move forward without you...",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "Yes... Back then, I was timid, fragile, and easily scared... I couldn't move forward without you..."
    },
    {
        "id": 148,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   I might even look the same way right now.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "I might even look the same way right now."
    },
    {
        "id": 149,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   But the difference is, I've now seen more than enough tragedies.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "But the difference is, I've now seen more than enough tragedies."
    },
    {
        "id": 150,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   I don't want to see something like this happen ever again.",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "I don't want to see something like this happen ever again."
    },
    {
        "id": 151,
        "raw": "[name=\"Amiya\"]   ...But nothing will change unless I face reality!",
        "type": "dialog",
        "speaker": "Amiya",
        "content": "...But nothing will change unless I face reality!"
